    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const sheetRecord = $json;\n\nconst contentIdea = sheetRecord['Content Idea'] || '';\nconst topic = sheetRecord['Topic'] || '';\nconst service = sheetRecord['Service'] || '';\nconst cta = sheetRecord['CTA'] || '';\nconst link = sheetRecord['Link'] || '';\nconst platform = sheetRecord['Platform'] || 'facebook';\nconst rowId = sheetRecord['Row ID'] || '';\nconst seoKeywords = sheetRecord['SEO Keywords'] || '';\n\nconst scriptPrompt = `You are a professional social media copywriter and SEO specialist.\n\nTRENDING TOPIC: ${topic}\nCONTENT IDEA: ${contentIdea}\nSERVICE: ${service}\nCTA: ${cta}\nSEO KEYWORDS TO USE: ${seoKeywords}\n\nWrite a Facebook post SCRIPT structured for maximum SEO and engagement:\n\n1. HOOK: First sentence MUST begin with \"${topic}\" \u2014 use a bold question or shocking statement.\n2. PROBLEM: 2 sentences about the real pain point. Naturally include 2 SEO keywords from [${seoKeywords}].\n3. SOLUTION: 2 sentences showing how \"${service}\" solves this. Use 2 more SEO keywords.\n4. CTA: Use EXACTLY this text: \"${cta}\"\n\nSEO REQUIREMENTS:\n- \"${topic}\" keyword appears minimum 3 times total\n- Use at least 4 of these keywords naturally: ${seoKeywords}\n- Max 150 words\n- Output ONLY the script. No section labels. No headings. No preamble.`;\n\nconst imagePrompt = `${topic}, ${service}, ${contentIdea}, ultra-realistic professional photography, 4K high resolution, vibrant dynamic composition, cinematic lighting, trending 2026 aesthetic, social media ready, wide angle, no text overlay, no watermark, photorealistic`;\n\nreturn [{\n  script_prompt: scriptPrompt,\n  content_idea: contentIdea,\n  topic: topic,\n  service: service,\n  cta: cta,\n  link: link,\n  platform: platform,\n  row_id: rowId,\n  seo_keywords: seoKeywords,\n  image_prompt: imagePrompt,\n  sheet_row: sheetRecord\n}];"
      },
      "id": "fbec9c37-8eb2-4d90-bce3-5733bc07a8ce",
      "name": "Build_SEO_Prompt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        784,
        208
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "llama-3.3-70b-versatile",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.5
        }
      },
