    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const item = $input.first().json;\nconst script = (\n  item.output ||\n  item.message?.content ||\n  item.choices?.[0]?.message?.content ||\n  item.text ||\n  'Script generation failed'\n).trim();\n\nconst promptData = $('Build_SEO_Prompt').first().json;\n\nconst topicHashtag = (promptData.topic || '').replace(/\\s+/g, '');\nconst keywordHashtags = (promptData.seo_keywords || '')\n  .split(',')\n  .map(k => '#' + k.trim().replace(/\\s+/g, ''))\n  .join(' ');\n\nconst postPrompt = `You are a Facebook SEO content specialist and viral copywriter.\n\nTRENDING TOPIC: ${promptData.topic}\nCONTENT IDEA: ${promptData.content_idea}\nSERVICE: ${promptData.service}\nCTA: ${promptData.cta}\nLINK: ${promptData.link || '[add your link]'}\nPRIMARY KEYWORD: ${promptData.topic}\nSEO KEYWORDS: ${promptData.seo_keywords}\n\nBased on this script:\n${script}\n\nWrite a highly SEO-optimized Facebook post. Follow this EXACT structure:\n\nLine 1 (HOOK): MUST start with \"${promptData.topic}\" in the first 3 words. Use a question or bold emotional statement that stops the scroll.\nLines 2-4 (BODY): Expand on the pain point and insight. Use SEO keywords NATURALLY \u2014 never forced. Each sentence should provide real value.\nLines 5-6 (SOLUTION): How \"${promptData.service}\" addresses this trend. Include 2+ additional SEO keywords.\nLine 7 (CTA): Use EXACTLY: ${promptData.cta}\nLine 8 (LINK): ${promptData.link || '[your link]'}\nLine 9 (HASHTAGS): Exactly 10 hashtags \u2014 include: #${topicHashtag} ${keywordHashtags} plus 3 broad reach tags like #Trending #Viral #MustRead\n\nSEO REQUIREMENTS:\n- \"${promptData.topic}\" appears MINIMUM 3 times in the body (not counting hashtags)\n- Use minimum 5 of these keywords naturally: ${promptData.seo_keywords}\n- Total word count: 180-220 words (Facebook's sweet spot for reach)\n- Use 5-7 relevant emojis placed for maximum visual scanning\n- Hashtags on the LAST line only\n- Output ONLY the post text. No labels. No preamble. No explanation.`;\n\nreturn [{\n  generated_script: script,\n  post_prompt: postPrompt,\n  image_prompt: promptData.image_prompt,\n  content_idea: promptData.content_idea,\n  topic: promptData.topic,\n  service: promptData.service,\n  cta: promptData.cta,\n  link: promptData.link,\n  platform: promptData.platform,\n  row_id: promptData.row_id,\n  seo_keywords: promptData.seo_keywords,\n  sheet_row: promptData.sheet_row\n}];"
      },
