        "jsCode": "// Pull context from Extract_Post_Output (single item at this point)\nconst data = $('Extract_Post_Output').first().json;\n\nconst topic   = (data.topic   || 'trending topic').trim();\nconst service = (data.service || 'modern solution').trim();\nconst idea    = (data.content_idea || '').trim();\nconst seo     = (data.seo_keywords || '').split(',').slice(0,3).map(k=>k.trim()).join(', ');\n\n// Cinematic 8-second video prompt \u2014 short, visual, action-driven\nconst videoPrompt = [\n  `Cinematic 4K footage: ${topic}.`,\n  `Visual story about ${idea}.`,\n  `Showcasing ${service} in action.`,\n  `Fast-paced dynamic cuts, vibrant colours, trending 2026 aesthetic.`,\n  `${seo}.`,\n  `Ultra-realistic, no text, no watermark, social media ready short video clip.`\n].join(' ');\n\nreturn [{\n  video_prompt: videoPrompt,\n  topic:   data.topic,\n  row_id:  data.row_id,\n  generated_post: data.generated_post\n}];"
      },
      "notes": "Builds a cinematic text-to-video prompt from topic/service/idea. Runs in parallel with image generation."
